OL,3,GNEWSATed Lasso mimics Delia's 'let's be
OL,4,Ahaving you' rant
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Norwich City fans, it's a familiar
OL,7,Frallying cry.
OL,9,FFor global fans of Ted Lasso, the Apple
OL,10,FTV+ comedy drama following a US coach
OL,11,Fmanaging an English side - not so much.
OL,13,FIn 2005, the Canaries' majority
OL,14,Fshareholder took to the pitch at
OL,15,Fhalf-time, grabbed a microphone and, to
OL,16,Feveryone's shock, angrily hollered
OL,17,F"where are you?" at supporters.
OL,19,FAnd now, Delia Smith's infamous rant at
OL,20,FCarrow Road has been celebrated in the
OL,21,FTV show from across the pond.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
